  "description": "This Building Block proposes a schema representation of the OpenEO process [`last`](https://processes.openeo.org/#last) \u2014 *Last element*. It models the `arguments` object of a process graph node invoking `last`. This is a proposed correspondence between the OpenEO process definition and an OGC Building Block schema, not a settled equivalence.\n\nGives the last element of an array.\n\nAn array with solely no-data values returns the no-data value (or `null`).\n\n## Source\n\nOpenEO Processes specification: [`last`](https://processes.openeo.org/#last) ([openeo-processes/last.json at 2.0.0-rc.2](https://github.com/Open-EO/openeo-processes/blob/2.0.0-rc.2/last.json)).\n",
  "examples": [
